{"id":315,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为丰富校园文化生活，打造文明温馨的宿舍环境，强化宿舍安全管理，提升宿舍长履职能力与责任意识，2026年6月14日16时，中北大学机电工程学院在11112H教室顺利举办宿舍文化大赛暨宿舍长大会。参赛宿舍全体成员以及全体大一宿舍长参与本次活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EM7leaMRvYM4n7LyNQRnmCZLRMfMlrhVU4LinzviU4A2MmU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yPL1yDLYyZUNMkMRW7M4CPU494U4GDn7MkUzU4LmliUzWFLzvbnzNbL7VFMRV7Mm7Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNPLmUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19124&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F12638BCB42D761C83C06DCBA43255A2/179E990A/41D61\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EM7leaMRvYM4n7LyNQRnmCZLRMfMlrhVU4LinzviU4A2MmU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yPL1yDLYyZUNMkMRW7M4CPU494U4GDn7MkUzU4LmliUzWFLzvbnzNbL7VFMRV7Mm7Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNPLmUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19124&e=.jpg\"></p><p>活动现场内容丰富、秩序井然。首先，优秀学长代表郭裕杰上台分享经验，他围绕宿舍学风建设、舍友相处之道、宿舍安全等内容展开细致讲解，为在场同学提供了实用的参考与借鉴。随后，各参赛宿舍依次借助PPT进行展示，生动展现出各具特色的宿舍风貌与集体风采。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EUlne7L4lZUl7sLyNUsnmGZolCiLlnhRnlUbLRf2LmGbUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy4L1yaoSy8M8LiMR-anmlPLzCDMNQfMRCaUN-aLm9iUlQFM4fkn7Q7L46FL8-aU4NJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNPLmUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19124&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E320947C5420F511666FA460BB0285AF/70BDFD37/3B0C9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EUlne7L4lZUl7sLyNUsnmGZolCiLlnhRnlUbLRf2LmGbUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy4L1yaoSy8M8LiMR-anmlPLzCDMNQfMRCaUN-aLm9iUlQFM4fkn7Q7L46FL8-aU4NJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNPLmUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19124&e=.jpg\"></p><p>活动期间，为筑牢安全防线、营造文明和谐的宿舍文化氛围，生活部学生骨干在现场开展了安全知识答题互动环节，并为参与同学发放精美小礼品。同时在现场还开展了消防安全知识宣传，并播放心理微电影，引导同学们重视宿舍安全与心理健康。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EolQe2Um9ZnR9PMyRGDozrRU8nVUlQhVL4viU4T2UmU8L490gihFp2hmCIa0MkyZLYy8n1hfMmNDozLZUNLYnzT2o7WRnNrVUN-PnNL8L4QFL4GDMN-bMmfFMRU8UN7Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNPLmUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19124&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4834FA696938BC2E9F8BCFEEBB1FC436/3066B960/444BA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EolQe2Um9ZnR9PMyRGDozrRU8nVUlQhVL4viU4T2UmU8L490gihFp2hmCIa0MkyZLYy8n1hfMmNDozLZUNLYnzT2o7WRnNrVUN-PnNL8L4QFL4GDMN-bMmfFMRU8UN7Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNPLmUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19124&e=.jpg\"></p><p>经过综合评审，活动现场完成评比与颁奖环节。怡丁苑1号楼401宿舍斩获本次大赛一等奖，文瀛17号楼1044宿舍、1045宿舍荣获二等奖，7069、1042、7072三间宿舍获得三等奖。学院为获奖宿舍颁发了奖品及奖状。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EMNne7Mz-aoR7sUyNVVo7lanRARnm6hknRCinRNiUzrRnmG0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yZL1h7MkysMRlDUzGDn7l4ozQ7ollZnRn2M7MVMm-4UlMFM4WkMmvYMlVFMzNPL8lJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNPLmUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19124&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/682D47456A06DE396D9E8D4F4CE623AC/72B6725A/5913E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EM4QeRnmGYUl7PoyRLDUzGYLNQVLzCh8nm6RLlW2nmLZLNC0gihFp2hmCIa0okyZn1h2oSyZnzlbMmffMzW7U8L4MRNZolrRMmrVU49YM46FLmlPUNnfUlVFL4LDoRVfgtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLz-8gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19124&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次活动不仅表彰了宿舍建设先进集体，也进一步强化了全体宿舍长的责任担当，有效助推文明、和谐、向上的宿舍文化氛围建设。至此，本次宿舍文化大赛暨宿舍长大会圆满落幕。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jdgc.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EM7leaMRvYM4n7LyNQRnmCZLRMfMlrhVU4LinzviU4A2MmU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yPL1yDLYyZUNMkMRW7M4CPU494U4GDn7MkUzU4LmliUzWFLzvbnzNbL7VFMRV7Mm7Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNPLmUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19124&e=.jpg"}